- Do not emit or modify solution files, project files, package-management files, or files outside the assigned project.
{{ end }}
- Do not repeat work owned by another task unless an existing file must be updated to integrate this task.
- Treat the supplied contracts, decisions, and acceptance criteria as authoritative.
