- Never emit {{ solution_path }} or {{ project_path }}.
{{ end }}
- Each content value contains the complete final file.
- Emit only paths listed under Exact leaf artifacts when that section is present.

C# rules:
- Use {{ root_namespace }} as the namespace root.
- Prefer file-scoped namespaces for new files.
- Include every required using directive.
- Keep endpoint, business, storage, and DTO responsibilities separated according to the plan.
- Produce concrete, compilable behavior rather than illustrative code.
